  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、良い表情だったぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、すっごく楽しかったよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300502/2003005020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ……お仕事なのに楽しいなんて言っていいのかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300502/2003005020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん！　大切なことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにカメラマンさんのオーダーにも\r\nちゃんと応えられていたから大丈夫",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、プロデューサーは優しいなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300502/2003005020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ずっと見ててくれてありがとーっ！\r\n暑かったでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300502/2003005020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、全然──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ということもないか\r\nでも、撮影中は忘れてたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほらー\r\nプロデューサーも水着があったら良かったのになっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300502/2003005020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、水分はとっているから平気だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003005020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……そのお水もぬるそうだよー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
